<title>UK: Semple Cochrane Plc seeks main market listing.</title>
<headline>Semple Cochrane Plc seeks main market listing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semple Cochrane Plc, an engineering services group, said on Monday it planned to seek a full listing on London Stock Exchange via a placing.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock market flotation will mark a significant step in the on-going development of Semple Cochrane,&quot; said executive chairman and managing director Tom Clark in a statement.</p>
<p>The Paisley-based company, with operations in the U.K. and Thailand, said it would use the proceeds from the float to provide working capital.</p>
<p>The sponsor to the placing is Williams de Broe.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
